MODIFICATIONS (retained adaptation, September 2026)
- Pinned image plus disk-backed Engram and ARM64 compatibility integration.
- Mode-aware vision configuration and bounded wide-SWA attention fallback;
  sparse-indexer page/top-k compatibility changes.
- Retained narrow dense MXFP8 autotuning and HIGH DSpark K5 configuration.
- vllm-exl3 native geometry eligibility widened from 4096 / 1024-or-2048 to
  positive multiples of 128 (actual V4.1 TP2 is 5120 x 1152); native backend
  selected with bounded post-return execution counters. The complete modified
  Python file is runtime/rootfs/usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/vllm_exl3/exl3.py.
- Quantization sidecar/selection/resume safety fixes and a new guarded wrapper.
- Explicit download/build/configure/launch/verify controls and CPU tests.

